{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_27", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 146, "width": 1542, "height": 342, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_28", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 162, "width": 1498, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - LEAD FOLLOW-UP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - LEAD FOLLOW-UP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 198, "width": 1498, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A new enquiry from your website form is read the moment it arrives and a first reply is written from what they actually asked. Spam and test entries stop at step 3, before anything is sent. If your form tool\ncannot send to a webhook, step 1 becomes a Make mailhook on the form's notification email and nothing after it changes.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A new enquiry from your website form is read the moment it arrives and a first reply is written from what they actually asked. Spam and test entries stop at step 3, before anything is sent. If your form tool\ncannot send to a webhook, step 1 becomes a Make mailhook on the form's notification email and nothing after it changes.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_30", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1636, "y": 25, "width": 352, "height": 283, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": 1658, "y": 41, "width": 308, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - CRM UPDATES", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - CRM UPDATES", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 1658, "y": 77, "width": 308, "height": 81, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The lead is created in GoHighLevel, or\nupdated if they are already there, matched\non email and phone so each person is one\ncontact, with UK mobiles saved as +44 so\nGoHighLevel can text them.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The lead is created in GoHighLevel, or\nupdated if they are already there, matched\non email and phone so each person is one\ncontact, with UK mobiles saved as +44 so\nGoHighLevel can text them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_33", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2168, "y": 30, "width": 720, "height": 378, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 2190, "y": 46, "width": 676, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - RELIABLE, CONNECTED, DATA FLOWING CORRECTLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - RELIABLE, CONNECTED, DATA FLOWING CORRECTLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 2190, "y": 81, "width": 676, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your reliable process, connected systems and data flowing correctly between platforms, grouped\nhere: form, Make and GoHighLevel in one scenario, and a lead GoHighLevel refuses comes to your\ninbox with the reason. Failed runs nobody sees are the first gap I check in your current setup.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your reliable process, connected systems and data flowing correctly between platforms, grouped\nhere: form, Make and GoHighLevel in one scenario, and a lead GoHighLevel refuses comes to your\ninbox with the reason. Failed runs nobody sees are the first gap I check in your current setup.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_36", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3086, "y": -106, "width": 1744, "height": 474, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 3108, "y": -90, "width": 1700, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - ONGOING LEAD MANAGEMENT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - ONGOING LEAD MANAGEMENT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 3108, "y": -54, "width": 1700, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What they asked is saved on the contact as a note for whoever calls them back. New leads then get a card in your pipeline, the first text and your follow-up sequence, and someone already in GoHighLevel who enquires again becomes a task\nfor you. Room to add a booking step next, so the card moves when they book.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "What they asked is saved on the contact as a note for whoever calls them back. New leads then get a card in your pipeline, the first text and your follow-up sequence, and someone already in GoHighLevel who enquires again becomes a task\nfor you. Room to add a booking step next, so the card moves when they book.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 288, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_39